# Analysis & Pre-Thinking

**Core Requirements:**
- Child chats are not being loaded in tree navigator
- Move tree navigator from inline to drawer/floating menu (left side)
- Maintain recursive tree structure for nested children
- Load child chats dynamically when opening drawer
- Keep setup/template/script structure for all components

**Strategic Approach:**
1. Create new `ChatNavigatorDrawer.vue` component (floating menu/drawer)
2. Load all child chats recursively when drawer opens
3. Move tree rendering logic from ChatChildrenTree into drawer
4. Update ChatView.vue to trigger drawer opening
5. Add action to chats store for loading child hierarchy
6. Ensure lazy loading of nested children

**Dependencies & Risks:**
- Child chats must be loaded before tree renders
- Deep recursion could impact performance (add depth limit)
- Need to handle loading states while fetching children
- Drawer positioning and z-index management

**Target Files:**
- **Create:** `src/components/chat/ChatNavigatorDrawer.vue` (new drawer component)
- **Modify:** `src/store/chats.js` (add action to load child hierarchy)
- **Modify:** `src/views/ChatView.vue` (replace inline tree with drawer trigger)
- **Delete/Archive:** `src/components/chat/ChatChildrenTree.vue` (no longer needed inline)

---

## File 1: Create ChatNavigatorDrawer.vue

```vue src/components/chat/ChatNavigatorDrawer.vue
<script setup>
import ChatIcon from '@/components/chat/ChatIcon.vue'
</script>

<template>
  <div 
    v-if="isOpen"
    class="fixed inset-0 z-50 flex"
    @click.self="closeDrawer"
  >
    <!-- Backdrop -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/30" @click="closeDrawer"></div>

    <!-- Drawer Panel -->
    <div class="relative w-96 bg-base-100 shadow-xl flex flex-col h-full overflow-hidden">
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="shrink-0 p-4 border-b border-base-content/10">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold flex items-center gap-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group text-primary"></i>
            Task Navigator
          </h2>
          <button class="btn btn-sm btn-ghost" @click="closeDrawer">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-lg"></i>
          </button>
        </div>
        <div v-if="rootChat" class="text-sm text-base-content/60">
          {{ rootChat.name }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Loading State -->
      <div v-if="isLoading" class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-center">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
          <div class="loading loading-spinner loading-lg text-primary"></div>
          <span class="text-sm text-base-content/60">Loading tasks...</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tree Content -->
      <div v-else class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-4 scrollbar-thin">
        <!-- Root Chat Card -->
        <div
          v-if="rootChat"
          class="mb-4 p-3 rounded-lg border-2 cursor-pointer transition-all"
          :class="selectedChatId === rootChat.id
            ? 'border-primary bg-primary/10'
            : 'border-base-content/10 bg-base-200 hover:border-base-content/30'"
          @click="selectChat(rootChat)"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
            <ChatIcon :mode="rootChat.mode" class="text-sm" />
            <span class="font-bold text-sm truncate flex-1">{{ rootChat.name }}</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-base-content/40">{{ rootChat.messages?.length || 0 }}</span>
          </div>
          <div v-if="rootChat.description" class="text-xs text-base-content/60 line-clamp-2">
            {{ rootChat.description }}
          </div>
          <div v-if="totalDescendants" class="text-xs text-primary mt-1">
            {{ totalDescendants }} subtasks
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Children Tree -->
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <ChatNavigatorNode
            v-for="child in rootChildren"
            :key="child.id"
            :chat="child"
            :allChats="allLoadedChats"
            :selectedChatId="selectedChatId"
            :depth="0"
            @select="selectChat"
          />
        </div>

        <!-- Empty State -->
        <div v-if="!rootChildren.length && !isLoading" class="text-center text-sm text-base-content/40 py-8">
          <i class="fa-regular fa-inbox text-2xl block mb-2 opacity-50"></i>
          No subtasks
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <div class="shrink-0 p-4 border-t border-base-content/10 bg-base-200/50">
        <button 
          class="btn btn-sm btn-primary w-full gap-2"
          @click="$emit('add-subtask')"
        >
          <i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i>
          Add Subtask
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</template>

<script>
export default {
  components: { ChatIcon, ChatNavigatorNode: () => import('./ChatNavigatorNode.vue') },
  props: {
    isOpen: {
      type: Boolean,
      default: false
    },
    rootChat: {
      type: Object,
      required: true
    }
  },
  data() {
    return {
      isLoading: false,
      selectedChatId: null,
      allLoadedChats: []
    }
  },
  computed: {
    rootChildren() {
      return this.allLoadedChats
        .filter(c => c.parent_id === this.rootChat.id)
        .sort((a, b) => a.name > b.name ? 1 : -1)
    },
    totalDescendants() {
      const countDescendants = (parentId) => {
        const direct = this.allLoadedChats.filter(c => c.parent_id === parentId)
        return direct.length + direct.reduce((sum, child) => sum + countDescendants(child.id), 0)
      }
      return countDescendants(this.rootChat.id)
    }
  },
  watch: {
    isOpen(newVal) {
      if (newVal) {
        this.loadChildHierarchy()
      } else {
        this.selectedChatId = null
      }
    }
  },
  methods: {
    async loadChildHierarchy() {
      this.isLoading = true
      try {
        this.allLoadedChats = await this.$chats.loadChildrenHierarchy(this.rootChat)
      } catch (error) {
        console.error('Failed to load child hierarchy:', error)
        this.$storex.ui?.addNotification({ text: 'Failed to load tasks', type: 'error' })
      } finally {
        this.isLoading = false
      }
    },
    selectChat(chat) {
      this.selectedChatId = chat.id
      this.$emit('select', chat)
      this.closeDrawer()
    },
    closeDrawer() {
      this.$emit('close')
    }
  }
}
</script>
```

